abstract: >-
  OpenRebar lays the reinforcement of a flat slab on the map of required area
  that the calculation already drew: DXF isolines, a calibrated PNG, or a
  numeric field. A run writes bars, anchorage, laps, a schedule, a cutting plan
  cut by column generation, and an IFC4 file, and checks the provided area cell
  by cell against SP 63.13330.2018. The same drawing gives the same report.
